<title>LATVIA: RTF, RAUGS LONE RISERS AMID GENERAL LOSS OF GROUND.</title>
<headline>RTF, RAUGS LONE RISERS AMID GENERAL LOSS OF GROUND.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
